			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλαμοι</span>: as Subst.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ., ὁ</span>,
				<i>Egyptian house-boat</i> or <i>barge</i>, <i><span class="en">
